# Go source is line-ending sensitive to the tools rather than to the compiler:
# gofmt reports a CRLF file as unformatted, so `gofmt -l .` on a Windows
# checkout with core.autocrlf=true flags every file in the repository. Pinning
# the working tree to LF makes the standard checks mean the same thing
# everywhere.
*.go text eol=lf
go.mod text eol=lf
go.sum text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
